Hi, everyone,

I'm working on revamping the mlmmj website in an attempt to raise the profile of 
the project, improve the development process, and attract more users and 
developers. Shortly we should have more current documentation on the web, along 
with a publicly accessible source code repository, and a new bug and enhancement 
tracker.

To get us beyond the dullness of pure text, I'd like to have a logo. Ideally, it 
would remain largely unchanged for a long period, so it would be good to 'get it 
right' to start with. A good logo should represent what mlmmj is (a mailing list 
manager) and its style (simple, slim, joyful!).

So could you please look at the attached potential logo, whack reply, and let me 
know what you think of it?

Thanks a lot!

Ben.

P.S. If you're keen to help with this, or anything else mlmmj-related, please 
speak up.




